  values ('ME', 'short_answer', 'What is the molarity of an aqueous solution of ethanoic acid (CH3COOH) which contains 6.0 g of ethanoic acid in 500 ml of the solution? (3 marks)', 'Molar mass of CH3COOH = 2(12) + 4(1) + 2(16) = 60 g/mol. Moles of acid = 6.0 ÷ 60 = 0.1 mol. Volume = 500 ml = 0.5 L. Molarity = 0.1 ÷ 0.5 = 0.2 mol/L (0.2 M).', null, '[{"point": "Molar mass of CH3COOH = 60 g/mol", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Moles = 6.0 / 60 = 0.1 mol", "marks": 1}, {"point": "Molarity = 0.1 mol / 0.5 L = 0.2 M", "marks": 1}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'general-subject-knowledge'),
